VyaparNet PRDv2 — Final Architecture Freeze
VyaparNet PRDv2 — Final Architecture Freeze (Updated with Minor Improvements)
Status: ARCHITECTURE FROZEN — No additions without impact analysis
Date: 2026-05-22
Scope: MVP + Future-Ready Architecture
Initial Segments: Textile + Spare Parts
Initial Geography: Patna + Bihar

1. LOCKED CORE FOUNDATION
Product Vision — LOCKED
VyaparNet = Controlled single-storefront B2B procurement platform. Buyer trusts VyaparNet brand. Backend uses verified supplier network, city operators, virtual inventory, selective owned stock, and consolidated logistics.

Long-term: Data-rich, AI-enabled, logistics-optimized, fintech-capable B2B operating system with curated marketplace.

