12. LOCKED WORKFLOW DEFINITIONS
Order Lifecycle
Draft/Request
→ Availability Check
→ Price Confirmation
→ Buyer Confirmation
→ Procurement Assigned
→ Supplier Confirmed
→ QC Pending
→ Packed
→ Dispatched
→ In Transit
→ Delivered
→ Accepted
→ Closed
Exception States: Stock Not Available, Price Changed, Buyer Cancelled, Supplier Delayed, QC Failed, Delivery Failed

Procurement Workflow
Order confirmed
→ Source selected (score-based)
→ Procurement task created
→ Supplier/operator confirms stock
→ Price locked
→ Goods collected/shipped
→ QC evidence uploaded
→ Dispatch
Return / Dispute Workflow
Issue raised within allowed window
→ Evidence collected (photo/voice/video)
→ Root cause assigned
→ Decision: reject / replace / refund / credit-note
→ Reverse logistics (if approved)
→ Financial settlement
→ Score update
→ Case closed
Quote / RFQ Workflow
Buyer request (text/photo/voice/paper)
→ Requirement clarification
→ Supplier/source search
→ Quote prepared
→ Buyer approval
→ Order conversion
